{
  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative efforts to balance safety, efficiency, and sustainability. I propose a synthesis where we maintain the jerk constraint during normal operations but allow for a controlled increase during Minimal Risk Maneuvers (SAF-02, RES-03) to ensure safety while optimizing performance. Additionally, I support integrating energy efficiency and data protection measures into EFF-01 and EFF-05, ensuring that these considerations enhance performance without compromising safety or ethical responsibilities. This approach allows us to achieve a harmonious balance among all quality dimensions.",
